{"3574540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bladebearer: Recarved", "steam_appid": 3574540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574540/extras/825f9703f5320e14b7e72876b044c693.avif?t=1786462531\" width=800 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BE THE BLADE:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carve through the battlefield, defeating peasants, knights, and others in rhythm-game-like combat. Maneuver yourself to match blocks and counters. Uncover unique combos, and learn how to wield yourself in the hands of different warriors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WEAR THE WIELDER:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Swordsmen are disposable</i>; you are not. Experience the combat techniques and strength levels of different sword bearers. Use their lives to pursue your own goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES PLANNED FOR THE COMPLETED VERSION</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple weapon types with unique playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue-like upgrade system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-linear map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New endings</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574540/extras/825f9703f5320e14b7e72876b044c693.avif?t=1786462531\" width=800 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BE THE BLADE:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carve through the battlefield, defeating peasants, knights, and others in rhythm-game-like combat. Maneuver yourself to match blocks and counters. Uncover unique combos, and learn how to wield yourself in the hands of different warriors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WEAR THE WIELDER:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Swordsmen are disposable</i>; you are not. Experience the combat techniques and strength levels of different sword bearers. Use their lives to pursue your own goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES PLANNED FOR THE COMPLETED VERSION</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple weapon types with unique playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue-like upgrade system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-linear map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New endings</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "BE THE BLADE. WEAR THE WIELDER.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574540/609c07c5e11921a6a28762932c0ab949aa0f487b/header.jpg?t=1786462531", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574540/e7bf3e70b390f6cda5a9df5ed1aef6c74b139731/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786462531", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574540/e7bf3e70b390f6cda5a9df5ed1aef6c74b139731/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786462531", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64bit Microsoft® Windows® 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.5 GHz CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4096 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.0 (DirectX® 10) compliant graphics card and driver<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Lukko Digital"], "publishers": ["Lukko Digital"], "package_groups": [